{"seq":1,"slug":"accounting-fundamentals","title":"会计基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/accounting/accounting-fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"accounting-basics-principles","title":"会计基础与原则","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/accounting/accounting-fundamentals/accounting-basics-principles","wordCount":1487,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"bookkeeping-methods","title":"记账方法","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/accounting/accounting-fundamentals/bookkeeping-methods","wordCount":1431,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"accounting-vouchers-books","title":"会计凭证与账簿","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/accounting/accounting-fundamentals/accounting-vouchers-books","wordCount":1758,"readingTime":8}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"会计基础-简介\">会计基础 简介</h1><p>会计基础是会计事务专业的入门核心课程，为后续所有专业课程提供理论根基和操作规范。本章从会计的基本含义出发，逐步建立起完整的会计知识框架，使学生能够理解经济业务背后的会计逻辑。</p>\n<p>本章内容分为三个部分：</p>\n<p><strong>会计基础与原则</strong>讲解会计的含义与两大基本职能（核算与监督），阐述会计基本假设（会计主体、持续经营、会计分期、货币计量）的内涵与意义。重点剖析六大会计要素——资产、负债、所有者权益、收入、费用、利润——的定义与确认条件，并推导会计等式 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>资产</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>负债</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>所有者权益</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{资产} = \\text{负债} + \\text{所有者权益}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">资产</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">负债</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">所有者权益</span></span></span></span></span></span> 的经济含义。</p>\n<p><strong>记账方法</strong>系统介绍借贷记账法这一国际通用的复式记账方法。从&quot;有借必有贷，借贷必相等&quot;的基本规则出发，讲解各类账户的结构与分类方式，通过试算平衡验证记录的正确性，并安排大量实操练习巩固理解。</p>\n<p><strong>会计凭证与账簿</strong>聚焦会计工作的日常操作流程。学习原始凭证（发票、收据、银行单据等）的审核要点，掌握记账凭证的规范填制方法，练习日记账、明细账和总账的登记技巧，以及划线更正法、红字更正法和补充登记法三种错账更正方法。</p>\n<p>学习本章时建议理论与实训交替进行：先理解概念，再动手填制凭证、登记账簿。手工练习是建立会计直觉的最有效方式，务必反复操练至熟练。</p>\n"}